@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Fresh narrow lineage: SEN0414 Chapters 11, 17 and 16 corrections"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.39.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.39.0> ; owl:priorVersion <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1617corr-lineage/1.38.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1617corr_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.39.0 (2026-11-25): Chapter 16 spec story done. The generic builder runs the new spec (08-tooling/ch16-deck/spec_v3_0_0) and builds deck 3.0.0 (54 slides, 25 examples) and manifest 1.1.0. All 25 examples have the same code, printed result, slide number and name as the old build (log spec_vs_old_build.log: PASS); the manifest self-check passes. Because the generic builder refuses old-form notes and story cards, the spec already holds reader-facing notes, plain concept rows and story cards; the deck story keeps its checks and its review."""@en .

ex:TK10_Spec_16_Build backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done 2026-11-25. Spec made from the old builder's files; plain concept rows (no everyday analogies), notes of 60 to 140 words for every slide, and story cards of at most 30 words were written here because the generic builder refuses the old forms. The example code is unchanged from deck 2.0.1." .
ex:TK10_Spec_16_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done 2026-11-25. Old manifest 1.0.1 against new manifest 1.1.0: 25 of 25 examples equal in code, expected result, slide and name; manifest self-check PASS. Not yet done (belongs to the deck story): the material check, deck standard, overlap, story prose, story repeat and analogy word search on the new deck; nine code slides where the builder warns that the result has less room than it wants (the cat checker has 0.14 in); lambdas still in the example code; the story pictures still include portraits of public figures from the approved earlier deck." .
ex:ST10_Spec_16 backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Done 2026-11-25; the acceptance criterion holds for the examples. The open items of the Verify task go to ST10_Deck_16." .
ex:ST10_Deck_16 backlog:hasAuditNote "Ready 2026-11-25. Part of its content work exists already (notes, plain rows, story cards, see the spec story). Its task list stays: lengthen short titles, remove lambdas, give the layout warnings a fix, build, then run and read all the checks." .
